sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Shop
    participant Payments
    participant Stock
    Customer->>Shop: place order
    activate Shop
    Shop->>Stock: reserve items
    Stock-->>Shop: reserved
    Shop->>Payments: charge card
    activate Payments
    alt accepted
        Payments-->>Shop: receipt
        Shop-->>Customer: confirmation
    else declined
        Payments-->>Shop: declined
        Shop->>Stock: release items
        Shop-->>Customer: try another card
    end
    deactivate Payments
    deactivate Shop
    Note right of Stock: reservations expire after 15 minutes
